{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.088477373085254343,"y":0.037691401718329187,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.23251027425130211,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"h":0.015434968878720201,"c":1,"y":0.08338627371234808,"w":0.3130997212727864,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.090356563396268214},{"y":0.11457944207083082,"t":"This response provides a range of ideas on the value of knowing about history, but","w":0.78234909057617186,"x":0.13559611579103509,"c":1,"h":0.023550664859048331},{"c":1,"t":"not specifically about the history of houses or buildings people live in. The main","w":0.74936477661132805,"h":0.023095071385971111,"x":0.13560065098501714,"y":0.13200920994173104},{"t":"points are addressed but the ideas that relate directly to the question are limited.","w":0.76172856648763021,"c":1,"y":0.14990798645965964,"x":0.13554096144236097,"h":0.02375663155240082},{"x":0.13561089511419547,"y":0.1862110936909499,"w":0.68970072428385421,"h":0.022513649067693486,"c":1,"t":"The response is organised into four paragraphs, with an introduction and"},{"y":0.20302328150046867,"x":0.13562949671361746,"t":"conclusion. Each main paragraph covers one of the points in the question, but the","c":1,"h":0.022916077163390725,"w":0.77604868570963537},{"w":0.76378687540690104,"c":1,"t":"lack of focus means that there is a lack of overall progression. Cohesive devices","x":0.13354929861527826,"y":0.22055179047009688,"h":0.023768758605310136},{"c":1,"t":"are used well [First of all | Consequently] but there are some errors [For this aims].","w":0.78020619710286443,"h":0.023542352503404751,"x":0.13763930368828264,"y":0.23800954711526412},{"h":0.023537032595792873,"y":0.27382109290394574,"w":0.76173390706380206,"t":"Vocabulary is the strongest part of this response, with some examples of higher-","c":1,"x":0.13766298374569791},{"t":"level collocation [hectic lifestyle | peace in our souls | finding their feet | broad","x":0.13556931567211677,"w":0.73300989786783854,"h":0.023179345192701373,"c":1,"y":0.29164182618145507},{"x":0.13768431430462433,"y":0.31027254303806884,"h":0.022888320635289006,"c":1,"t":"spectrum of knowledge | impermanence of life | mutual objectives]. There are a","w":0.74727828979492195},{"w":0.45918838500976555,"h":0.019594428396056407,"t":"variety of sentence structures but errors remain.","x":0.13767023879450188,"y":0.32972944304498142,"c":1},{"x":0.13969674489356426,"h":0.024308888735282475,"c":1,"w":0.77825759887695312,"y":0.36169113951007636,"t":"To improve this response, the candidate should refer more closely to the 'house or"},{"t":"building' rather than the hometown.","x":0.13991769899263606,"y":0.38515901081452542,"w":0.33744855244954425,"h":0.017457268403753168,"c":1},{"y":0.91133720914629712,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"132","x":0.10082304586498267,"h":0.013081395583944722}]}